    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... the noise. People are so obsessed with nothing. Their problems are so small, their lives are so surface level. I saw things that were real, things that actually meant something, and coming back to this? It feels like I'm trapped in a simulation. It’s exhausting trying to pretend I’m part of this, when I know I’m not. I feel like I’m just waiting for the credits to roll.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
